OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786040303
OL,3,CPolice failed to arrest abuser after
OL,4,Cwarrant issued months before toddler
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,FPolice failed to arrest a child abuser
OL,8,Fdespite a warrant being issued 18
OL,9,Fmonths before he murdered and sexually
OL,10,Fassaulted his girlfriend's two-year-
OL,11,Fold daughter.
OL,13,FIsabelle Welsh suffered from weeks of
OL,14,Fabuse, including suffering 21 broken
OL,15,Fbones, before she collapsed at her
OL,16,Fhome in Thornaby, Teesside, in
OL,17,FSeptember.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/7
