FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786040303
OL,3,CPolice failed to arrest abuser after
OL,4,Cwarrant issued months before toddler
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,FAlexandra Walker, 26, and her
OL,8,Fboyfriend Harrison Simpson, 22, were
OL,9,Fconvicted of murder and child cruelty
OL,10,Flast week following a trial at
OL,11,FTeesside Crown Court.
OL,13,FSimpson was also convicted of sexually
OL,14,Fassaulting Isabelle, while her mother
OL,15,Fwas cleared of that charge.
OL,17,FCleveland Police has admitted that
OL,18,Fofficers failed to execute a warrant
OL,19,Fissued by Teesside Magistrates' Court
OL,20,Ffor Simpson's arrest in March 2024,
OL,21,FThe Sunday Times reported.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
