OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786040303
OL,3,CPolice failed to arrest abuser after
OL,4,Cwarrant issued months before toddler
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,FThe warrant was issued after Simpson
OL,8,Ffailed to attend court for breaching a
OL,9,Fnon-molestation order, an injunction
OL,10,Fdesigned to protect victims of
OL,11,Fdomestic abuse.
OL,13,FIt is understood that the non-
OL,14,Fmolestation order was put in place
OL,15,Fafter reports that Simpson had
OL,16,Fharassed and threatened a woman.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
