OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786040303
OL,3,CPolice failed to arrest abuser after
OL,4,Cwarrant issued months before toddler
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,FThe force said in a statement:
OL,8,F"Multiple enquiries and arrest
OL,9,Fattempts were carried out to try to
OL,10,Flocate and arrest him, but these
OL,11,Fproved unsuccessful."
OL,13,FIt added: "We recognise the time
OL,14,FSimpson had an outstanding arrest
OL,15,Fwarrant is far from adequate.
OL,17,F"A review of this was immediately
OL,18,Fconducted upon his arrest for murder.
OL,26,@pD@AOUsD@UO]uD@KOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
