OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786040303
OL,3,CPolice failed to arrest abuser after
OL,4,Cwarrant issued months before toddler
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,F"This review, along with a
OL,8,Fdetermination to continually improve
OL,9,Four processes around suspect
OL,10,Fmanagement, has led to a number of
OL,11,Frecent changes, such as ongoing
OL,12,Fimproved visibility across the force
OL,13,Faround outstanding warrants, a
OL,14,Fcomprehensive data system which tracks
OL,15,Fall outstanding warrants, and
OL,16,Fstringent oversight including a
OL,17,Fgovernance group led by a
OL,18,Fsuperintendent."
OL,26,@oD@AOUzD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/7
