OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786040303
OL,3,CPolice failed to arrest abuser after
OL,4,Cwarrant issued months before toddler
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,FMs Justice Norton said Isabelle's
OL,8,Fmurder was the final act in a
OL,9,Fsustained campaign of violence, which
OL,10,Fthe pair then attempted to cover up.
OL,12,FShe jailed them for life with minimum
OL,13,Fterms of 28 years and six months for
OL,14,FSimpson and 22 years for Walker, both
OL,15,Fminus time spent on remand.
OL,17,FProsecutor Paul Abrahams told the
OL,18,Fcourt: "This was a campaign of quite
OL,19,Fdeliberate extreme violence."
OL,26,@zD@HOU{D@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/7
