OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,399,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F398A1786040303
OL,3,CPolice failed to arrest abuser after
OL,4,Cwarrant issued months before toddler
OL,5,Cmurder
OL,7,FMs Justice Norton said: "Any death is
OL,8,Fa tragedy. The death of a very young
OL,9,Fchild at the hands of those who should
OL,10,Fhave cared for, protected, and loved
OL,11,Fher ` as she no doubt loved them ` is
OL,12,Fparticularly distressing for all
OL,13,Finvolved."
OL,15,FShe said the toddler sustained an
OL,16,Funsurvivable head injury in the 24
OL,17,Fhours before she died in hospital.
OL,19,FThe girl was sexually assaulted around
OL,20,Fthe time the fatal blow was inflicted,
OL,21,Fthe judge said.
OL,26,@oD@YOUuD@JO]
